{
  "name": "dsh-chanhub",
  "version": "0.1.10",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 客户端插件：在设置侧边栏接入 chanhub（WorkBuddy2API）上游网关的可视化面板，复用 dsh-bridge-gateway 的设计语言。",
  "releaseNotes": "【dsh-chanhub 0.1.10】TraeWork 添加账号改为「粘贴地址栏」完成（远端可用）\n• 上一版设想的「回调打到面板」方案已被证伪：Trae 授权页硬性要求回调是 http://127.0.0.1:<port>/authorize，非 loopback 一律显示「网络错误，请刷新页面重试。」（授权页源码里的正则校验，真实原因是这个）\n• 现在：发起登录后弹窗常驻粘贴框，明确说明「浏览器会跳到一个打不开的地址，这是 Trae 的限制不是故障，地址栏里带着凭证，整段复制回来即可」；提交后由网关完成换 token\n• 网关：回调恒为 loopback + 15 分钟 TTL；重复提交拒绝（后来者无法覆盖本次登录）；不含凭证的粘贴明确报错且不污染中间态，用户可立刻重贴\n• 测试 136 用例通过；真机验证「发起 → 粘贴 → 越过 pending 进入真实换 token」全链路",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node client/build.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build:client",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.25.9"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": ">=0.1.0-rc.6"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "chanhub",
    "workbuddy2api",
    "gateway",
    "openai-compatible",
    "panel"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git@github.com:lament-z/dsh-chanhub.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/lament-z/dsh-chanhub/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/lament-z/dsh-chanhub",
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public",
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/"
  }
}
